# The project brief, as written by its author. Not ours to reformat.
# Prettier renumbers its ordered lists (it "corrected" a deliberate 1,2,4,5,6)
# and escapes asterisks in paths, both of which rewrite the source spec.
.claude/Agent.md

# Go owns its own formatting — gofmt runs via a PostToolUse hook.
*.go
go.sum

# PostgreSQL DDL. Prettier has no SQL parser and would leave it untouched anyway;
# listing it makes that explicit rather than accidental.
*.schema
*.sql

# The design the frontend is built FROM, imported as-is. It is a reference
# artifact rather than source we maintain, and reformatting it would make every
# future diff against the original unreadable.
frontend/design/

node_modules/
frontend/dist/
backend/bin/
.git/
